## Loading Strategy

```
1. Session start → This file + fact.yml (auto via `CLAUDE.md` or equivalent root file)
2. Need detail → Load relevant layer on demand
3. Task complete → Append to episodic.jsonl (auto via session-log hook)
4. Periodic background → memory_decay.py / memory_consolidate.py
5. Session end → Clear scratchpad if task finished
```

